	// UsersUpdateWithBody Update a user
	//
	// Requires `ORG_ADMIN` or `UNIT_ADMIN`, and a unit admin only within their own unit. Only an organization admin can modify an account that is itself an admin. A user cannot update their own record here.
	//
	// Takes any type of body and a specified content type.
