	// Calling it on an account that is already deactivated changes nothing. A UNIT_ADMIN is limited to their own unit and may not deactivate an admin account, and nobody may deactivate their own.
	//
	// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
	//
	// Corresponds with POST /api/v1/users/{user_id}/deactivate (the `UsersDeactivate` operationId).
